# Event GH Frontend Standards

## Inertia and Routing
- Build screens as Inertia React pages under `resources/js/pages`.
- Do not hardcode internal URLs in React code.
- Use Wayfinder route/action imports from `@/routes/*` and `@/actions/*`.
- Regenerate route functions after route/controller changes: `php artisan wayfinder:generate`.

## UI and Styling
- Use Tailwind utilities in JSX/TSX; avoid inline hardcoded color styles.
- Reuse design tokens from `resources/css/app.css` (for example `bg-bg-global`, `border-border`, `text-success`).
- Prefer existing shared components (`resources/js/components` and `resources/js/components/ui`) before creating new ones.

## App Structure
- Keep page/layout conventions from `resources/js/app.tsx`.
- Follow existing admin/client split under `resources/js/pages/admin` and `resources/js/pages/reservations`.
